I also flagged a landing hazard. My #7614 (in the queue) and #7544 both edit the same resolution-facts Go fixture and its expected counts, and both add a Go salt token. Whichever lands second has to keep both fixture additions, re-bless the counts with a cause for each line, and keep both tokens in landing order. The queue can't do that automatically.

